{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1464.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"3ca805a3e15e1acd025dca7f40e9895e4a23727e5a58eb8dda035f49e23aefeb","ja":"生地を注いで、具材を入れて……ちょっと\n固まってきたところで……一気に回転っと♪","zh":"倒上面糊，放入馅料……稍微\n凝固一些之后……一口气翻面♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1464.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"cd0e7f72879abce572db64e2b607c37056d80bd4225c9ea577df38610aa093c9","ja":"おお～。\nキレイなまん丸になりましたな～。","zh":"哦哦～。\n变成漂漂亮亮的正圆形了呢～。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1464.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"edbc484a67802d82ef4fe227a6ee67647e68b6cd37a914cc097799ece3104504","ja":"へへ～ん、任せとき！\nどんどん焼いてくから、モリモリ食べてな♪","zh":"嘿嘿～，包在我身上！\n我会源源不断地烤出来，放开肚皮大吃特吃吧♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1464.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"40686dd55f336192c9f4157c489c4abae09cb89ab05d6b5bb3c41d6fe86dde70","ja":"はい……歩さん。ソースと……青のりたっぷりの、\nたこ焼き……できた、よ……♪","zh":"好的……步小姐。酱汁和……海苔粉放得满满的，\n章鱼烧……做好了、哦……♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1464.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"14f4971da3fc9806eeb89dd1ced746acb0217cdeb47e18e2106b01e5696611ae","ja":"サンキュー、杏奈！　ん～、ソースの香りが\nたまんないなぁ……いっただっきまーす！","zh":"谢谢，杏奈！嗯～酱汁的味道\n让人欲罢不能啊……我开动啦——！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1464.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"02b0f5813b01f1cf45466745fabd61886c6043c99efee118b4c512a055ce2062","ja":"ぱくっ……んんー！？\nあふっ、あふっ、あっふぅーいっ！！","zh":"嗷呜……嗯嗯——！？\n哈呼、哈呼、好烫呼——！！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1464.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"203f8c0682d020b899fca4ec9bb82a3c6f32430ba7d6a8cb6bb0678bae81d104","ja":"わっ……！　あ、歩さん、だい、じょうぶ……！？\nお水、お水……！","zh":"哇……！步、步小姐，你、你没事吧……！？\n水、水……！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1464.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"cb6c414b558c87931ae1dbeea11802495734c3eea38da1324f022b9941740098","ja":"ゴクゴクゴク……っぷはぁ～！　焦った～……\n杏奈も気をつけて！　これ、すっごく熱いから！","zh":"咕嘟咕嘟咕嘟……哈啊～！好烫好烫～……\n杏奈也要小心哦！这个非常烫的！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1464.unity3d","item_key":"commands[26].text","source_sha256":"85b2613c51a40971c3262edc33808f9a141c54885ef3bf5843da7ae8e02b1e03","ja":"？　美也、何入れとんの？","zh":"？　美也，你在往里面放什么呢？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1464.unity3d","item_key":"commands[27].text","source_sha256":"834b1ad2349d00b1a572db85e7981c4e8c41a9a886884477854479903197f5d8","ja":"チョコとあんこですよ～。\nデザート焼きを作ろうと思いまして～♪","zh":"是巧克力和红豆馅哦～。\n我想做个甜点烧～♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1464.unity3d","item_key":"commands[28].text","source_sha256":"369ff9195a9920c7b15ead402d2b097fe66d65db68e702597c3877ad06495f12","ja":"チョコにあんこ……一緒に入れたら、どんな味に\nなるんかな？　それやったら……。","zh":"巧克力加红豆馅……一起放进去的话，会变成什么\n味道呢？要是那样的话……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1464.unity3d","item_key":"commands[33].text","source_sha256":"f57cfdaa3423982ac99cb2c739d50536ade8181714dd218d7b7e16d5029bb1e3","ja":"10分後……","zh":"10分钟后……","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1464.unity3d","item_key":"commands[34].text","source_sha256":"99b266a3090372f9e3bf21f5872007c5cb63c33b3190ca6b8ea619f49992d29a","ja":"できた！　みんな、ちょっとこれ見て！","zh":"做好了！大家快来看看这个！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1464.unity3d","item_key":"commands[35].text","source_sha256":"93974bac64979769191683027cce4bd677854fe2d98f4bb7b7fffe30fd3fd94a","ja":"えーっと……お皿に、\nたくさんのたこ焼きが乗ってますな～？","zh":"那个……盘子里，\n放了好多章鱼烧呢～？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1464.unity3d","item_key":"commands[36].text","source_sha256":"58cb0ca66ebce4e2710e394e402883fbae519a49d5f6680dd24fbfdcb464f9d9","ja":"ふっふーん、そう思うやろ？\nけど、中身はタコちゃう！","zh":"哼哼～你觉得是那样吧？\n不过，里面可不是章鱼！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1464.unity3d","item_key":"commands[37].text","source_sha256":"3916abbee7956d3739e883380e4d418fda6043211f5012cb2fba7cc639f4954c","ja":"この中に、ハズレは1個だけ……。\nつまり、ロシアンたこ焼きやんな♪","zh":"这里面，只有1个是整蛊地雷……\n也就是说，是俄罗斯轮盘章鱼烧对吧♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
